Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}父ちゃんが生きてるって…。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我爸还活着……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}おい　待てよ！！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 等等！！
